        -:  878:
        -:  879:    /** Return a reverse iterator to the first element of the reversed container.
        -:  880:
        -:  881:        The pointed-to element corresponds to the
        -:  882:        last element of the non-reversed container.
        -:  883:        If the container is empty, @ref rend() is returned.
