        -:  888:        @par Exception Safety
        -:  889:        No-throw guarantee.
        -:  890:    */
        -:  891:    inline
        -:  892:    reverse_iterator
        -:  893:    rbegin() noexcept;
        -:  894:
        -:  895:    /** Return a const reverse iterator to the first element of the reversed container.
        -:  896:
        -:  897:        The pointed-to element corresponds to the
        -:  898:        last element of the non-reversed container.
        -:  899:        If the container is empty, @ref rend() is returned.
        -:  900:
        -:  901:        @par Complexity
