        -:  909:    rbegin() const noexcept;
        -:  910:
        -:  911:    /** Return a const reverse iterator to the first element of the reversed container.
        -:  912:
        -:  913:        The pointed-to element corresponds to the
        -:  914:        last element of the non-reversed container.
        -:  915:        If the container is empty, @ref crend() is returned.
        -:  916:
        -:  917:        @par Complexity
        -:  918:        Constant.
