        -:  943:
        -:  944:    /** Return a const reverse iterator to the element following the last element of the reversed container.
        -:  945:
        -:  946:        The pointed-to element corresponds to the element
        -:  947:        preceding the first element of the non-reversed container.
        -:  948:        The element acts as a placeholder; attempting
        -:  949:        to access it results in undefined behavior.
        -:  950:
        -:  951:        @par Complexity
