        -:  960:
        -:  961:    /** Return a const reverse iterator to the element following the last element of the reversed container.
        -:  962:
        -:  963:        The pointed-to element corresponds to the element
        -:  964:        preceding the first element of the non-reversed container.
        -:  965:        The element acts as a placeholder; attempting
